{"id":"791381s-m17","title":"Native و Tagged و Untagged","order":17,"lessons":[{"id":"791381s-m17-l00","title":"افتتاحية الوحدة","order":0,"pages":[{"id":"791381s-m17-l00-p01","title":"Native و Tagged و Untagged","order":1,"layout":"opener","source":{"kind":"book","sourceId":"791381s","pdfPageStart":48},"blocks":[{"id":"m17-l00-p01-opener","type":"unit-opener","origin":"book","unitLabel":"الدفعة الرابعة · كتاب ص 135–138","unitNumber":"17","title":"Native و Tagged و Untagged","subtitle":"كيف يعرف السويتش لأي VLAN تنتمي كل رسالة تمرّ في كابل Trunk؟"}]}]},{"id":"791381s-m17-l01","title":"Native و Tagged و Untagged","order":1,"pages":[{"id":"791381s-m17-l01-p01","title":"ما هو الـ Tag؟","order":1,"source":{"kind":"book","sourceId":"791381s","pdfPageStart":48,"pdfPageEnd":49},"blocks":[{"id":"m17-l01-p01-def","type":"text","origin":"book","spans":[{"text":"الـ Tag = علامة داخل الحزمة تخبر السويتش: هذه الحزمة تابعة لـ VLAN رقم كذا.","style":"strong"}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p01-intro","type":"text","origin":"book","spans":[{"text":"في كابل Trunk تمرّ رسائل من عدة VLAN معًا. حتى لا تختلط، نلصق على كل رسالة «ملصقًا» عليه رقم VLAN — مثل ملصق اسم الصف على دفتر الطالب."}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p01-drawing","type":"diagram","origin":"book","src":"/learning-assets/791381s/0cf86d4a49977049.png","alt":"شريط حزمة مقسوم إلى أجزاء: «فحص»، «البيانات»، جزء مؤطّر بخط عريض مكتوب فيه «Tag» و«VLAN 10»، ثم «MAC».","caption":"الحزمة مع Tag (علامة) فيها رقم VLAN"}]},{"id":"791381s-m17-l01-p02","title":"الأنواع الثلاثة","order":2,"source":{"kind":"book","sourceId":"791381s","pdfPageStart":49},"blocks":[{"id":"m17-l01-p02-cards","type":"list","origin":"book","variant":"cards","items":[{"id":"m17-l01-p02-c1","term":"Tagged · مع علامة","text":[{"text":"الحزمة تحمل رقم VLAN. تُستخدم عبر وصلات "},{"text":"Trunk","style":"strong"},{"text":". "},{"text":"مثال:","style":"strong"},{"text":" VLAN 10 و 20"}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p02-c2","term":"Untagged · بدون علامة","text":[{"text":"الحزمة بدون Tag. تظهر في منافذ "},{"text":"Access","style":"strong"},{"text":" للأجهزة العادية. "},{"text":"مثال:","style":"strong"},{"text":" حاسوب، طابعة"}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p02-c3","term":"Native · الأصلية","text":[{"text":"VLAN تمرّ عبر "},{"text":"Trunk بدون Tag","style":"strong"},{"text":"، للتوافق مع أجهزة قديمة. "},{"text":"يُفضّل","style":"strong"},{"text":" تغييرها من VLAN 1"}]}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p02-remember","type":"callout","origin":"book","kind":"remember","title":"تذكّر","spans":[{"text":"Access","style":"strong"},{"text":" = لجهاز عادي (بدون Tag).   "},{"text":"Trunk","style":"strong"},{"text":" = وصلة بين أجهزة الشبكة (مع Tag)."}]}]},{"id":"791381s-m17-l01-p03","title":"إعداد Native VLAN","order":3,"source":{"kind":"book","sourceId":"791381s","pdfPageStart":49,"pdfPageEnd":50},"blocks":[{"id":"m17-l01-p03-intro","type":"text","origin":"book","spans":[{"text":"بشكل تلقائي تكون Native VLAN هي VLAN 1. لأسباب أمنية نغيّرها إلى رقم آخر لا نستعمله للأجهزة، مثل 99."}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p03-cli-h","type":"heading","origin":"book","level":4,"text":"Switch CLI","dir":"ltr"},{"id":"m17-l01-p03-cli","type":"code","origin":"book","language":"cli","dir":"ltr","code":"① Switch(config)# interface f0/24\n② Switch(config-if)# switchport mode trunk\n③ Switch(config-if)# switchport trunk native vlan 99"},{"id":"m17-l01-p03-steps","type":"list","origin":"book","variant":"ordered","items":[{"id":"m17-l01-p03-s1","text":[{"text":"نختار المنفذ الذي يربط بين السويتشات (F0/24)."}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p03-s2","text":[{"text":"نجعله Trunk حتى يمرّر عدة VLAN."}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p03-s3","text":[{"text":"نجعل VLAN 99 هي الـ Native بدل VLAN 1."}]}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p03-why","type":"callout","origin":"book","kind":"summary","title":"لماذا؟","spans":[{"text":"الـ Native VLAN لا تحمل Tag على وصلة Trunk، لذلك يُفضّل "},{"text":"عدم تركها على VLAN 1","style":"strong"},{"text":" لأسباب أمنية."}]}]},{"id":"791381s-m17-l01-p04","title":"إعداد Tagged VLAN عبر Trunk","order":4,"source":{"kind":"book","sourceId":"791381s","pdfPageStart":50},"blocks":[{"id":"m17-l01-p04-intro","type":"text","origin":"book","spans":[{"text":"نستطيع أن نحدّد أي VLAN مسموح لها أن تمرّ في كابل Trunk، فلا يمرّ إلا ما نحتاجه."}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p04-cli-h","type":"heading","origin":"book","level":4,"text":"Switch CLI","dir":"ltr"},{"id":"m17-l01-p04-cli","type":"code","origin":"book","language":"cli","dir":"ltr","code":"① Switch(config)# interface f0/24\n② Switch(config-if)# switchport mode trunk\n③ Switch(config-if)# switchport trunk allowed vlan 10,20"},{"id":"m17-l01-p04-steps","type":"list","origin":"book","variant":"ordered","items":[{"id":"m17-l01-p04-s1","text":[{"text":"نختار منفذ الوصلة."}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p04-s2","text":[{"text":"نجعله Trunk ليسمح بمرور عدة VLAN."}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p04-s3","text":[{"text":"allowed vlan 10,20","style":"strong"},{"text":": نسمح فقط لـ VLAN 10 و 20 بالمرور."}]}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p04-benefit","type":"callout","origin":"book","kind":"summary","title":"الفائدة","spans":[{"text":"كل حزمة تحمل Tag برقم VLAN، فيعرف السويتش في الطرف الآخر مصدر كل حزمة ويرسلها للقسم الصحيح."}]}]},{"id":"791381s-m17-l01-p05","title":"إعداد Untagged / Access (تذكير)","order":5,"source":{"kind":"book","sourceId":"791381s","pdfPageStart":50,"pdfPageEnd":51},"blocks":[{"id":"m17-l01-p05-cli-h","type":"heading","origin":"book","level":4,"text":"Switch CLI","dir":"ltr"},{"id":"m17-l01-p05-cli","type":"code","origin":"book","language":"cli","dir":"ltr","code":"① Switch(config)# interface f0/1\n② Switch(config-if)# switchport mode access\n③ Switch(config-if)# switchport access vlan 10"},{"id":"m17-l01-p05-steps","type":"list","origin":"book","variant":"ordered","items":[{"id":"m17-l01-p05-s1","text":[{"text":"منفذ لجهاز نهائي مثل حاسوب."}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p05-s2","text":[{"text":"المنفذ ينتمي إلى VLAN واحدة."}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p05-s3","text":[{"text":"الجهاز يرسل ويستقبل "},{"text":"بدون Tag","style":"strong"},{"text":"."}]}]},{"id":"m17-l01-p05-table","type":"table","origin":"book","headers":["النوع","Access Port","Trunk Port"],"rows":[["متصل بـ","جهاز عادي (حاسوب، طابعة)","سويتش آخر أو راوتر"],["كم VLAN؟","VLAN واحدة","عدة VLAN"],["Tag؟","بدون Tag","مع Tag (ما عدا Native)"],["الأمر","switchport mode access","switchport mode trunk"]]}]}]}]}
